WEBVTT

00:14.110 --> 00:15.830
<i>Alpha, Beta, Gamma...</i>

00:15.830 --> 00:17.140
<i>Surround the target.</i>

00:24.850 --> 00:26.220
<i>Are you trembling?</i>

00:26.220 --> 00:27.290
<i>You're quite naïve for an ALFR.</i>

00:27.290 --> 00:28.630
You're quite naïve for an ALFR.

00:29.700 --> 00:33.010
Now, go kill the traitor!

00:36.740 --> 00:37.970
<i>Tear them apart!</i>

00:46.480 --> 00:52.860
Arve Rezzle
– Mechanized Fairies –

01:09.730 --> 01:11.470
<i>This is the 4 o'clock news.</i>

01:11.470 --> 01:17.030
<i>The Okinotorishima Mega-Float City administrative government, in cooperation with Alvin Corporation,</i>

01:17.030 --> 01:19.590
<i>held a joint news conference at noon today</i>

01:19.590 --> 01:27.860
<i>announcing the discovery of the root cause behind Early Rapture, the worldwide simultaneous mind-loss incident...</i>

01:34.140 --> 01:37.200
<i>Attention, passengers. In 10 minutes, we will be landing on</i>

01:37.200 --> 01:44.040
<i>Okinotorishima Mega-Float City, OMFC, at Tamana International Airport.</i>

01:56.330 --> 02:00.260
<i>Thank you for using Okinotorishima unmanned taxi service.</i>

02:03.850 --> 02:05.020
<i>Destination confirmed.</i>

02:05.370 --> 02:07.470
<i>Please fasten your seatbelt.</i>

02:07.840 --> 02:08.980
<i>Now departing.</i>

02:26.780 --> 02:30.000
I'm here, Shiki.

02:40.430 --> 02:41.850
The stun blade...

02:42.840 --> 02:44.390
So you used it.

02:48.290 --> 02:49.860
<i>Hey, Remu.</i>

02:49.860 --> 02:50.840
<i>The truth is,</i>

02:53.180 --> 02:57.030
there's something I need to confess to you.

02:58.580 --> 02:59.540
A confession?

02:59.540 --> 03:01.770
Huh? What's with the reaction?

03:02.320 --> 03:07.040
Ah! Are you expecting a confession of love, by any chance?

03:07.930 --> 03:09.550
We're siblings. I wouldn't think that.

03:09.550 --> 03:13.170
Aw! I wouldn't mind if you blushed for me.

03:13.170 --> 03:15.920
Idiot. I'm going to hang up if you keep saying stupid things.

03:16.790 --> 03:19.690
Chill out! It's just a joke!

03:19.690 --> 03:22.930
If your own sister makes your heart pound, you should probably get a girlfriend.

03:24.260 --> 03:25.980
So, what did you need to confess?

03:29.580 --> 03:30.360
The truth is,

03:31.030 --> 03:33.910
what you see on the screen isn't really me.

03:34.330 --> 03:34.860
Huh?

03:35.290 --> 03:38.000
Sorry, I'm sure you're confused.

03:38.000 --> 03:40.780
It's hard for me to explain.

03:41.040 --> 03:43.860
In other words, it's like this...

03:45.660 --> 03:50.770
This is merely an image of me being produced by a software program.

03:51.230 --> 03:53.980
It's not a real image of my own body.

03:56.250 --> 03:57.170
Same thing with my voice.

03:59.850 --> 04:00.590
Currently, the real me is like this:

04:11.640 --> 04:16.400
I'm using NLN, neural-linked nanomachines,

04:16.400 --> 04:18.410
along with a body pool.

04:18.840 --> 04:21.120
It's really convenient.

04:21.120 --> 04:24.310
Eating, going to the toilet, sleeping...

04:24.310 --> 04:28.120
I can focus on studying without having to worry about these bothersome tasks.

04:28.670 --> 04:33.710
It's actually pretty expensive, but my school takes care of that for me.

04:33.710 --> 04:36.500
A lot of the people I know use it as well.

04:37.610 --> 04:38.600
Why?

04:39.440 --> 04:41.180
It's supposed to be a secret,

04:41.180 --> 04:43.580
but I thought you deserved to know.

04:44.430 --> 04:47.460
I want to be able to stand out on my own as soon as possible.

04:47.900 --> 04:51.590
I want to follow the dream my dad and mom had

04:51.590 --> 04:53.510
and become a renowned scientist in the field.

04:54.150 --> 04:55.170
That's what I've decided to do.

04:56.870 --> 04:59.990
The dream... of your true parents?

05:00.620 --> 05:04.980
Yeah. I came to know after reading Dad and Mom's book.

05:04.980 --> 05:06.830
This is what it said...

05:13.270 --> 05:14.070
Shiki...

05:25.740 --> 05:26.670
Where am I?

05:28.790 --> 05:31.120
Who is... this child?

05:36.140 --> 05:37.690
The patient has awoken!

05:38.370 --> 05:39.620
Response teams to the ward!

05:40.380 --> 05:42.520
Lock the doors. Don't let them escape!

05:45.370 --> 05:46.480
I have to go.

05:51.620 --> 05:52.520
This body...

05:57.000 --> 05:58.750
Listen to me.

05:59.640 --> 06:01.080
Hurry! Hurry!

06:05.470 --> 06:08.640
I won't hurt you, Mikage Shiki.

06:09.260 --> 06:11.430
Mikage Shiki?

06:12.280 --> 06:14.730
But, I'm...

06:15.200 --> 06:17.150
You were involved in an accident on Next Life.

06:17.520 --> 06:21.130
You lost your soul and we treated you at this hospital.

06:21.370 --> 06:25.960
Thanks to our treatment, your soul has returned to your body.

06:26.360 --> 06:28.930
I imagine your memory is still hazy,

06:28.930 --> 06:31.320
but we'll take care of that for you.

06:32.210 --> 06:33.800
Now, come.

06:36.710 --> 06:37.660
Grab her!

06:40.580 --> 06:41.540
I'm...

06:43.540 --> 06:44.420
Help me!

06:53.260 --> 06:54.550
Take me to the elevator.

06:56.450 --> 06:57.100
Hurry!

07:00.690 --> 07:02.450
NLN robot?

07:09.480 --> 07:10.160
Halt!

07:10.280 --> 07:11.160
Don't stop!

07:17.660 --> 07:18.950
Is there anything else?

07:21.550 --> 07:22.960
Don't move.

07:23.480 --> 07:24.010
Come.

07:30.620 --> 07:31.360
Damn!

07:31.850 --> 07:32.510
Stand down.

07:33.120 --> 07:34.140
It's too late.

07:34.300 --> 07:35.270
U-Understood.

07:37.520 --> 07:40.650
She can manipulate machines through the network.

07:41.040 --> 07:43.360
She's an ALFR, too.

07:45.700 --> 07:46.720
This is Oberon.

07:47.270 --> 07:48.690
Dispatch Nomead.

07:49.270 --> 07:51.030
An ALFR escaped alone.

07:51.450 --> 07:52.370
Take care of them.

07:53.740 --> 07:54.660
Roger.

07:57.500 --> 08:00.630
Thanks for giving me the stun blade.

08:01.020 --> 08:03.880
You still take breaks from the body pool, right?

08:05.100 --> 08:06.670
I can't help but worry.

08:06.670 --> 08:08.670
Yeah, I guess.

08:08.670 --> 08:12.250
Some people stay in all the time, but I like to go out once in a while.

08:12.250 --> 08:13.620
So I'm happy.

08:13.620 --> 08:16.100
People who stay in all the time are kind of weird.

08:16.570 --> 08:18.520
You don't have to use it if you don't want to.

08:18.920 --> 08:20.780
Nah, I'll use it,

08:20.780 --> 08:22.000
just in case something happens.

08:22.330 --> 08:24.870
Besides, it's something you gave me.

08:25.550 --> 08:26.310
I see.

08:27.860 --> 08:30.880
Do you mind if I confess one more thing, Remu?

08:31.310 --> 08:32.240
What is it?

08:32.240 --> 08:34.710
Have you ever heard of Next Life?

08:35.500 --> 08:37.020
Basically,

08:37.570 --> 08:44.390
it's a service consisting of virtual world that you experience through your five senses using NLN.

08:45.740 --> 08:48.390
Like that Second Life game from a while back?

08:50.130 --> 08:51.580
It's even better!

08:52.130 --> 08:53.950
What do you think?

08:53.950 --> 08:56.970
It looks pretty fun. Could be a nice way to chill out.

08:57.480 --> 09:00.160
You can join if you'd like. Let's play together!

09:00.930 --> 09:02.850
I see. I'll think about it.

09:04.350 --> 09:05.110
See ya!

09:07.820 --> 09:14.300
We've just received an update regarding "Early Rapture", the worldwide simultaneous mind-loss incident

09:09.610 --> 09:25.000
Many people mourn
while questions are raised over
the safety of body pools.

09:14.300 --> 09:16.490
that occurred on the night of March 25th.

09:16.800 --> 09:24.350
Among the users of Next Life, a virtual space utilizing neural-linked nanomachines, or NLN for short,

09:24.350 --> 09:31.260
52,535 people have experienced severe brain damage resulting in a persistent vegetative state.

09:31.620 --> 09:37.970
Furthermore, 253,345 users have already lost their lives as a result of the incident.

09:50.250 --> 09:54.030
It's all because you used NLN.

10:01.410 --> 10:01.830
Yeah.

10:12.900 --> 10:13.810
Shiki?

10:27.220 --> 10:28.700
Am I dreaming?

10:29.900 --> 10:31.850
U-Um...

10:31.850 --> 10:33.970
I'm glad you've come back, Shiki.

10:34.390 --> 10:37.220
Well, I...

10:37.630 --> 10:38.270
"I"?

10:38.270 --> 10:39.410
W-Wait!

10:41.500 --> 10:45.340
I'm... probably not the person

10:45.920 --> 10:48.130
that you think I am.

10:48.560 --> 10:50.610
You're Shiki, right?

10:50.610 --> 10:52.720
I don't know. I don't know!

10:53.740 --> 10:58.140
I'm not sure that the body I'm in right now is my own.

10:58.660 --> 11:00.930
Huh? What do you mean?

11:01.300 --> 11:03.310
Maybe you're right.

11:03.310 --> 11:05.520
Maybe I am the one you say I am.

11:05.520 --> 11:08.080
But I might also be a completely different person.

11:08.080 --> 11:09.110
I mean...

11:09.700 --> 11:10.890
Early Rapture...

11:11.520 --> 11:17.110
Every soul that was connected to Next Life was briefly separated from their bodies during that terrible incident.

11:17.600 --> 11:22.620
How do you know that each soul made its way back to the right body afterwards?

11:22.620 --> 11:25.080
How... How do you know?

11:26.860 --> 11:27.670
This isn't right.

11:28.120 --> 11:29.640
You've just forgotten, right?

11:30.130 --> 11:33.980
Don't you remember? This is the room you lived in!

11:35.020 --> 11:36.630
I'm your older brother!

11:36.630 --> 11:38.340
Let go of me!

11:39.960 --> 11:42.330
I don't know... I don't know.

11:45.690 --> 11:47.170
Put some clothes on.

11:48.410 --> 11:51.260
Even if you don't have any memory of being Shiki,

11:52.520 --> 11:55.400
I can't let my own sister be in this condition.

11:56.950 --> 11:57.780
Your...

11:58.170 --> 11:59.200
<i>Shiki's</i> clothes...

12:00.700 --> 12:01.750
There's plenty to choose from.

12:03.220 --> 12:04.200
I understand.

12:04.950 --> 12:08.080
Thank you... very much.

12:14.230 --> 12:14.800
You...

12:14.800 --> 12:16.920
Are you really not Shiki?

12:17.880 --> 12:18.840
You're Shiki, right?

12:19.530 --> 12:23.430
Your memories are just cloudy after being asleep for two months, right?

12:24.330 --> 12:25.770
I hope that's true.

12:26.760 --> 12:29.770
I would be relieved if you,

12:29.770 --> 12:32.130
who hugged me so kindly,

12:32.570 --> 12:34.120
are my real older brother.

12:34.830 --> 12:37.430
However, I can't just accept that.

12:38.740 --> 12:41.860
I have nothing but uncomfortable feelings for this body.

12:41.860 --> 12:44.860
It feels awkward and difficult to move.

12:45.230 --> 12:49.460
I don't even know if this body is right-handed or left-handed.

12:50.210 --> 12:53.630
But I've noticed that the right hand is harder to move.

12:53.630 --> 12:56.870
I'm starting to think that it's left-handed.

12:57.470 --> 13:01.250
If I simply lost my memories, would I forget something so innate?

13:02.150 --> 13:03.150
That's...

13:03.850 --> 13:04.710
Also,

13:05.810 --> 13:10.700
Um... These breasts are too heavy. They feel different.

13:11.460 --> 13:14.160
I don't remember carrying these things on my chest.

13:14.610 --> 13:22.520
Or rather, I don't even have any memories of what my former body felt like at all in the first place.

13:22.960 --> 13:23.750
But still...

13:26.370 --> 13:27.090
This way!

13:36.370 --> 13:38.000
Dummy signal, huh?

13:38.480 --> 13:39.180
However...

13:40.900 --> 13:42.150
There's another person?

13:42.610 --> 13:45.050
Shit. They don't have NLN.

13:45.600 --> 13:47.390
I'll need to get physical.

13:49.520 --> 13:51.810
Hey, what are those things?

13:51.810 --> 13:56.490
U.S. Military standard tactical mobile anti-personnel machines, Wardogs.

13:56.490 --> 13:59.730
They can be controlled wirelessly over the network.

13:59.730 --> 14:01.020
Wireless control?

14:03.450 --> 14:05.860
There's someone controlling it?

14:05.860 --> 14:10.520
Yes. By analyzing traffic on the network, that much is obvious.

14:10.950 --> 14:11.250
They're coming!

14:25.510 --> 14:26.730
What did you do?

14:27.330 --> 14:30.850
I showered their optical sensors with nutrient medium

14:31.080 --> 14:34.110
and turned on the heater so they can't use infrared.

14:36.270 --> 14:38.850
Let's go. It won't last for long.

14:41.090 --> 14:42.020
Shit!

14:42.020 --> 14:45.470
You have the ability to control systems with NLN?

14:46.980 --> 14:47.570
What is it—

14:58.850 --> 14:59.450
This way.

15:08.330 --> 15:09.440
What did you do?

15:11.160 --> 15:12.530
What did you make me swallow?

15:13.870 --> 15:14.810
NLN.

15:16.250 --> 15:19.300
You idiot! Don't you know how dangerous NLN is?

15:19.300 --> 15:23.680
People like me can pick up the movement of the enemy with NLN.

15:23.680 --> 15:29.660
As long as you don't have NLN, the enemy will try to find you using optical or infrared cameras.

15:29.660 --> 15:32.800
There's a limit to what my dummy signal can do.

15:33.410 --> 15:37.420
See? Your signal is already being controlled by NLN.

15:37.800 --> 15:39.170
The enemy picked it up as well.

15:39.680 --> 15:42.040
The dummy NLN signal, that is.

15:44.020 --> 15:44.790
No...

15:45.190 --> 15:48.380
There's no way you're the Shiki that I know.

15:50.790 --> 15:51.700
Where are you going?

15:52.340 --> 15:55.600
I'm going to go find the controller of those Wardogs and defeat them.

15:56.020 --> 15:57.980
Are you sure you can defeat them?

15:58.670 --> 16:02.690
I think so. I can defeat them if I try.

16:03.650 --> 16:06.950
It doesn't feel right though.

16:06.950 --> 16:09.040
Ending it with so many questions left unanswered.

16:10.380 --> 16:12.840
Luckily, I have this power

16:13.400 --> 16:15.660
even if I don't know why.

16:16.080 --> 16:19.290
In fact, that's why I must survive:

16:19.290 --> 16:20.590
to find the reason.

16:22.730 --> 16:23.720
Do you...

16:25.690 --> 16:27.860
You wouldn't come with me, would you?

16:27.860 --> 16:29.090
I mean, I'm...

16:30.110 --> 16:33.510
I'm sorry for dragging you into all of this.

16:34.430 --> 16:36.190
But, I'm fine

16:36.660 --> 16:38.240
on my own.

16:39.100 --> 16:41.130
<i>I have amnesia, remember?</i>

16:41.720 --> 16:47.060
That's why I read Dad and Mom's book, and it said this:

16:47.580 --> 16:50.660
"Following your dreams may seem like moving forward,

16:50.660 --> 16:55.370
but you're really looking behind, pulling along the hands of troubled people."

16:55.370 --> 16:56.880
Pulling along the hands of troubled people?

16:57.470 --> 16:58.540
Yeah.

16:58.540 --> 17:00.890
Have you heard the term "resource satellite"?

17:01.630 --> 17:05.960
I learn many new words since I can search as much as I want.

17:08.080 --> 17:12.630
You're talking about pulling asteroids closer to Earth using rockets, right?

17:13.020 --> 17:13.800
Right.

17:13.800 --> 17:20.670
All of the wars and conflicts nowadays are caused by the scarcity of Earth's natural resources.

17:20.670 --> 17:22.060
If we could solve that...

17:22.530 --> 17:26.150
...then it would be pulling along the hands of troubled people, right?

17:26.510 --> 17:29.820
But right now, the project has been suspended

17:30.190 --> 17:34.200
because of Dad and Mom's... accident.

17:36.110 --> 17:38.790
I want to take over the project.

17:39.440 --> 17:44.540
That's why I'm eager to become a researcher and pursue that dream once again.

17:46.040 --> 17:49.250
If that's what you want to do, then you should do it.

17:49.880 --> 17:53.610
I'm relieved. I had a feeling you'd understand.

17:54.140 --> 17:55.870
You're kind, Remu.

17:55.870 --> 17:58.100
Just like Dad and Mom, I'm sure.

18:00.090 --> 18:02.850
You pull along the hands of troubled people.

18:03.470 --> 18:05.590
You're always teasing me,

18:06.040 --> 18:08.730
but that's the side of you that I...

18:09.350 --> 18:12.510
love.

18:15.430 --> 18:18.500
I want to believe that you're Shiki.

18:19.080 --> 18:23.040
But... I might not be her.

18:23.550 --> 18:30.310
Even so, she wouldn't appreciate it if I was cold-hearted towards a troubled person such as yourself.

18:31.100 --> 18:35.050
At the very least, even if you lost your memories,

18:35.550 --> 18:37.030
or even if you're not my little sister,

18:38.530 --> 18:42.320
a cold-hearted person is the last thing I would want to be.

18:47.590 --> 18:49.610
Remu-san...

18:49.610 --> 18:50.320
Remu-san...

18:55.430 --> 18:58.370
I have an idea. Can you follow my lead?

19:08.820 --> 19:09.910
Tear them apart!

19:17.460 --> 19:18.370
What the hell?

19:18.820 --> 19:19.540
Over here!

19:21.740 --> 19:22.430
Fire!

19:34.900 --> 19:41.450
So, you've interfered with my optic nerve NLN and the Wardogs' optical sensor at the same time.

19:42.490 --> 19:44.580
The ability to blind, so to speak.

19:44.580 --> 19:48.830
However, it seems that you're incapable of interfering with infrared signals.

19:49.150 --> 19:51.750
It's pointless. You can't defeat me.

19:51.750 --> 19:52.620
Bullshit!

19:55.720 --> 19:56.790
What is this?

20:06.370 --> 20:07.710
I-It...

20:10.070 --> 20:10.780
It can't be!

20:13.340 --> 20:16.780
You masked your body temperature by getting wet?

20:17.040 --> 20:20.700
But if you used an electrical attack in that condition...

20:20.700 --> 20:23.040
That's right.

20:23.040 --> 20:26.400
Naturally, I also took damage.

20:26.400 --> 20:27.380
However,

20:27.750 --> 20:31.030
you've already lost the ability to see through your blindness.

20:31.730 --> 20:34.680
Checkmate.

20:38.080 --> 20:39.290
Don't move.

20:40.670 --> 20:41.160
You...

20:41.160 --> 20:42.300
Now, tell me.

20:42.550 --> 20:45.180
I don't want to have to shoot you.

20:45.900 --> 20:48.810
Why did you attack us? Who are you?

20:48.810 --> 20:51.440
Also, this power that I have...

20:52.540 --> 20:53.440
What is it?

20:54.590 --> 20:57.020
So, I guess this is it.

21:09.590 --> 21:12.000
Would it really happen?

21:12.470 --> 21:17.630
Something as absurd as someone's consciousness mistakenly entering the wrong body?

21:21.810 --> 21:23.260
I guess so.

21:29.410 --> 21:30.420
I see.

21:32.990 --> 21:34.900
I'll help you.

21:35.430 --> 21:38.800
We'll find your real body.

21:38.800 --> 21:40.780
My real body?

21:41.520 --> 21:43.860
Right. It ought to be out there.

21:44.530 --> 21:47.200
If we find it, you can proudly live on

21:47.570 --> 21:49.500
without such an anxious face.

21:49.870 --> 21:51.990
You are a part of this world.

21:53.270 --> 21:55.170
I can... live.

21:56.350 --> 21:57.610
Proudly.

21:58.400 --> 22:01.310
That's why I want you to help me in return.

22:01.900 --> 22:04.140
Help me find my little sister's soul.

22:05.150 --> 22:07.680
We're both troubled people.

22:08.040 --> 22:11.710
Let's give each other a hand and fight together.

22:13.630 --> 22:15.240
Y-Yes!

22:15.600 --> 22:17.610
Thank you very much, Remu-san.

22:17.610 --> 22:20.510
Just "Remu" is fine. That's what Shiki called me.

22:20.510 --> 22:21.570
Alright.

22:22.230 --> 22:24.110
In that case, I'll be...

22:25.670 --> 22:27.570
Poem.

22:28.310 --> 22:28.990
"Poem"?

22:30.260 --> 22:30.880
Yes.

22:31.980 --> 22:35.940
Poem, from the meaning of the name "Shiki".

22:38.030 --> 22:43.000
I look forward to working with you, Poem.
